    "ath10k_core.ko is absent, so the ath10k mapping of CE0..CE7 to WMI control, HTT TX, HTT RX and pktlog CE1/CE5 cannot be read",
    "CE0..CE7 return 0 hits: the engine index is a runtime parameter, and the module never enumerates eight fixed rings",
    "the CE nentries values are runtime configuration; the only nentries=%d in the module belongs to a DFS command log, not a ring",
    "the mapping from logical service to physical engine is dynamic through HIFGetFreeQueueNumber, so no static table exists to recover",
    "pktlog has its own buffer lifecycle and size control, but which engine carries it was not determined",
    "no dynamic validation"
